; The fennec-SPECIFIC collection ppx RULES — NOT a ppx_rewriter. The [@@deriving collection] deriver
; (the store/reactive tail: collection + find + project) + the Mongo query DSL extensions ([%q] [%fields]
; [%sort] [%set] [%index]). Reuses the neutral codec/Fields generation from fennec.pulse.sift.ppx.rules
; ({!Sift_ppx_rules.model_core}). Both fur.ppx and the standalone fennec.pulse.collection.ppx link it
; (and, transitively, the sift rules), so a file pays ONE ppx process.
(library
 (name fennec_pulse_collection_ppx_rules)
 (public_name fennec.pulse.collection.ppx.rules)
 (libraries ppxlib fennec.pulse.sift.ppx.rules)
 (preprocess (pps ppxlib.metaquot)))
